# AI Video Dubbing (EN -> VI)

Du an long tieng tu dong video tieng Anh sang tieng Viet. Co 2 cach su dung:
- Streamlit UI: thao tac bang giao dien web
- CLI: chay pipeline tu terminal

## Kien truc pipeline

1. Tach audio tu video (`ffmpeg`)
2. Speech-to-text bang Whisper
3. Dich EN -> VI bang OpenAI hoac MarianMT
4. Tong hop giong noi tieng Viet (edge-tts, gTTS hoac VietTTS)
5. Tron audio long tieng vao video goc
6. Xuat video va file phu de `.srt`

## Cai dat

Yeu cau:
- Python 3.10+
- ffmpeg va ffprobe co trong PATH

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
copy .env.example .env
```

Neu dung OpenAI, dien `OPENAI_API_KEY` vao `.env`.

## Chay Streamlit app

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

## Chay bang CLI

```bash
python cli.py path/to/video.mp4 --translator marian
```

Vi du dung OpenAI:

```bash
python cli.py path/to/video.mp4 --translator openai --openai-api-key sk-...
```

Vi du chon VietTTS:

```bash
python cli.py path/to/video.mp4 --tts-engine viettts
```

## Dau ra

- Video da long tieng: `data/outputs/*_dubbed.mp4`
- Phu de: `data/outputs/*_dubbed.srt`

## Ghi chu

- Whisper/Transformers can tai model lan dau nen se cham hon.
- MarianMT chay offline, OpenAI cho chat luong dich tot hon.
- VietTTS la tuy chon optional. Neu chon `--tts-engine viettts` thi can cai thu vien VietTTS phu hop truoc.